 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                         MASTER SERVICES\n                                                  AGREEMENT\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 46001 Valencia, Spain\nCIF/NIF: ESB33309276\n\nFROM                                              FACTURAR A\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                         Distribuciones Ibérica SL\nAvenida Diagonal 220                              Calle Mayor 15\n46001 Valencia                                    28001 Madrid\nSpain                                             Spain\nVAT: ESB33309276\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 12/03/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220,\nValencia (\"Party A\"), and Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15,\nMadrid (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by Swedish law.\n\nSignatures\n Party A  Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Lucía Fernández\n Party B  Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Lucía Fernández\n Date     12/03/2026",
